.TH MCP-SERVER-WAKATIME 1 "October 2026" "mcp-server-wakatime 0.0.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mcp-server-wakatime \- MCP server exposing WakaTime summaries over stdio
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mcp-server-wakatime
[\fB\-\-version\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Model Context Protocol server speaking stdio. Provides the read-only tools
wakatime_summaries and wakatime_today.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B WAKATIME_API_KEY
WakaTime API key (required).
.SH SEE ALSO
mcprack(1)
